Overview
********

   Zebra is free routing software that manages TCP/IP based routing
protocols.  IPv6 routing protocols are also supported.  Zebra is
distributed under the GNU General Public License

   You can get the latest information from the Zebra web page:
`http://www.zebra.org/'.

