Installation
************

   Zebra is in the development stage, so there is no earlier official
release.  Zebra's beta package can be found at
`ftp://ftp.zebra.org/pub/zebra/'.  Once it is officially released it
will be found at GNU FTP archive sites.

   Zebra installation is very easy because of an excellent configure
script.  It automatically detects current states of the machine so
please check on kernel configurations before running configure scripts.

