Configuration File
******************

   Each of the Zebra beasts has its own configuration file.  For
example, zebra's default configuration file name is `zebra.conf'.
Program name plus `.conf' is the default configuration file name. You
can specify a configuration file by -f or -config-file option to the
daemon.

   In a configuration file, you can write the debugging options, a vty's
password, routing daemon configurations, a logfile name, and so on.

