bgpd
****

   bgpd is a Border Gateway Protocol 4 (BGP-4) protocol daemon.  BGP-4
is described in RFC1771.  bgpd also supports Multi Protocol Extension
for BGP-4 (sometimes known as BGP-4+ or MBGP) which is described in
RFC2283.

   BGP-4 is one of the EGPs (Exterior Gateway Protocols) and is used for
inter-domain routing messages.

* Menu:

* Invoking bgpd::
* bgpd Configuration::
* bgpd Terminal Mode Commands::
* bgpd Sample Session::
* bgpd Log Format::
* How to Set Up A 6-Bone Connection::


